   syntax: #substitute [{name}] [{substitution}]
   With no arguments, #substitute simply prints out all the substitutions
   for the current session.  With one argument, it prints out the
   substitutions which correspond to that pattern (wildcard * is supported).
   Otherwise it creates a substitute for the 'name' which will be
   substituted with 'substitution'.  Braces are advised around both
   'name' and 'substitution'.

   See also: unsubstitute
